# File: specs/347-deliver-generated-worker-prompts-exactly-once-before-settlement/feature.gherkin
#
# Generated from: specs/347-deliver-generated-worker-prompts-exactly-once-before-settlement/requirements.md
Feature: Deliver generated worker prompts exactly once before settlement
  Fresh execute sibling workers could settle after only com.nmg-sdlc.run
  and be recorded as missing_handoff before the generated prompt arrived.
  This was fixed by delivering that prompt exactly once to a live session
  before observation.

  # --- Bug Is Fixed ---

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: Bug is fixed
    Given execute starts a fresh standard or remediation --kind omp worker
    And agentStart reports the worker is interactively ready
    When execute inserts the canonical prompt through pane send-text and submits pane send-keys Enter
    Then it persists text_inserted before Enter and delivered only after Enter succeeds
    And it does not observe, settle, or close the worker before delivery

  # --- Related Behavior Still Works ---

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: No regression
    Given a matching retained worker has delivered or legacy prompt state
    When execute resumes or finishes observing that worker
    Then it sends no pane text and no Enter
    And a still-missing handoff after proven delivery remains missing_handoff and still closes the owned pane unless --retain-worker was requested

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: Enter failure recovery does not duplicate prompt text
    Given pane send-text succeeded and promptDelivery is text_inserted
    When pane send-keys Enter fails and execute is invoked again
    Then the retained pane remains prompt_pending
    And recovery sends only Enter without another text insertion

  @SCN004 @regression
  Scenario: Proven pre-insertion process loss restarts once
    Given pane send-text proves the ready worker process was lost before insertion
    When execute retries agentStart successfully in the same pane
    Then it inserts the canonical prompt once into the replacement and delivers before observation
